WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.583 --> 00:00:31.041
In the previous few verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:31.041 --> 00:00:34.125
described the qualities of an ideal devotee

3
00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:36.500
who is most dear to Him.

4
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:39.541
Here, continuing in the same sequence,

5
00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:43.291
He describes some more
qualities of such a devotee.

6
00:00:48.333 --> 00:00:49.583
Anapeksha,

7
00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:52.708
this verse begins with this word.

8
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:55.750
A true devotee is anapekshah,

9
00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.833
meaning they expect nothing from anyone,

10
00:00:59.833 --> 00:01:03.000
and for this reason, they neither
show favouritism,

11
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.333
nor get entangled in worldly disputes.

12
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.083
They are also free from material expectations.

13
00:01:09.083 --> 00:01:12.625
No worry about wealth, no hunger for fame,

14
00:01:12.625 --> 00:01:15.500
and no craving for honour.

15
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.666
Whatever comfort comes their way,

16
00:01:17.666 --> 00:01:20.083
they accept it as Lord Krishna's grace

17
00:01:20.083 --> 00:01:22.791
with a peaceful mind.

18
00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.083
But they do not live life

19
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:29.083
with the purpose of gaining
any material comfort.

20
00:01:29.083 --> 00:01:30.333
The second quality is

21
00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:33.291
shuchi, meaning pure.

22
00:01:33.291 --> 00:01:37.083
Both outwardly and inwardly pure.

23
00:01:37.083 --> 00:01:39.708
Here outer purity means

24
00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:42.000
maintaining personal cleanliness,

25
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:44.541
and living a simple life,

26
00:01:44.541 --> 00:01:47.958
and inner purity means no

27
00:01:47.958 --> 00:01:51.166
envy in the mind, no selfishness, and no

28
00:01:51.166 --> 00:01:54.625
kind of desire.

29
00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:57.083
A devotee is also dakshah,

30
00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:59.333
meaning skilled in their craft,

31
00:01:59.333 --> 00:02:01.125
and they complete every task

32
00:02:01.125 --> 00:02:04.041
with diligence and competence,
understanding that

33
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:04.916
all of this

34
00:02:04.916 --> 00:02:08.125
they are doing in service to Lord Krishna.

35
00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:09.791
If their work

36
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:12.083
helps someone else,

37
00:02:12.083 --> 00:02:15.041
this too is service to Lord Krishna, because

38
00:02:15.041 --> 00:02:18.833
this entire world belongs to Lord Krishna.

39
00:02:18.833 --> 00:02:21.416
They are also udasinah, meaning

40
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:22.791
they are not excessively

41
00:02:22.791 --> 00:02:25.000
influenced by any situation.

42
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.583
They do not get drawn into social

43
00:02:26.583 --> 00:02:28.083
or political disputes,

44
00:02:28.083 --> 00:02:31.125
speaking neither in favour of one side nor against.

45
00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:33.500
Their perspective is only one,

46
00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.791
that all these worldly matters

47
00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:40.375
are temporary, and after some time
everything will change.

48
00:02:40.375 --> 00:02:42.250
So whatever the situation,

49
00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.333
they are neither disturbed by it,

50
00:02:44.333 --> 00:02:46.583
nor elated.

51
00:02:46.583 --> 00:02:49.500
Such a devotee is also gata-vyathah,

52
00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.875
meaning beyond sorrow and suffering.

53
00:02:52.875 --> 00:02:54.041
If some difficulty

54
00:02:54.041 --> 00:02:55.791
comes in life,

55
00:02:55.791 --> 00:02:58.750
they do not feel discontent or complain.

56
00:02:58.750 --> 00:03:00.458
They have unwavering trust

57
00:03:00.458 --> 00:03:02.375
that whatever is happening

58
00:03:02.375 --> 00:03:04.958
is happening by Lord Krishna's will,

59
00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:06.833
and they see every

60
00:03:06.833 --> 00:03:09.125
joy and sorrow

61
00:03:09.125 --> 00:03:10.125
with the same eye.

62
00:03:10.125 --> 00:03:14.541
And finally, they are sarvarambha-parityagi,

63
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:18.791
one who does every action free from selfishness,

64
00:03:18.791 --> 00:03:20.166
and renounces

65
00:03:20.166 --> 00:03:22.541
the fruit of every deed.

66
00:03:22.541 --> 00:03:26.750
They offer this renunciation
at Lord Krishna's feet,

67
00:03:26.750 --> 00:03:29.416
because their one purpose is this alone,

68
00:03:29.416 --> 00:03:32.541
devotion to Lord Krishna,
and through their actions,

69
00:03:32.541 --> 00:03:34.375
service to Him.

70
00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:40.083
And all these qualities make
them most dear, for Lord Krishna.

71
00:03:44.541 --> 00:03:46.875
Have you ever thought

72
00:03:46.875 --> 00:03:49.375
about what the root cause of
most of life's sorrows

73
00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:52.791
and pain is?

74
00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:55.958
Your expectations.

75
00:03:55.958 --> 00:03:58.916
You wish that people

76
00:03:58.916 --> 00:04:02.333
treat you in a special way.

77
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:05.000
You expect that if

78
00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:09.000
you have worked hard, it will be appreciated.

79
00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:12.625
You desire that life

80
00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:16.291
continues according to the plans you have made.

81
00:04:16.291 --> 00:04:19.208
And when this does not happen,

82
00:04:19.208 --> 00:04:22.125
the mind becomes restless,

83
00:04:22.125 --> 00:04:25.083
Pain follows.

84
00:04:25.083 --> 00:04:29.083
Now imagine.

85
00:04:29.083 --> 00:04:31.791
A life where

86
00:04:31.791 --> 00:04:35.333
you hold no expectation

87
00:04:35.333 --> 00:04:38.083
in return for any behaviour

88
00:04:38.083 --> 00:04:40.791
or any effort of yours.

89
00:04:40.791 --> 00:04:43.666
You want nothing from anyone.

90
00:04:43.666 --> 00:04:47.083
If praise comes, you accept it,

91
00:04:47.083 --> 00:04:49.083
and feel no ego.

92
00:04:49.083 --> 00:04:52.083
If someone treats you specially,

93
00:04:52.083 --> 00:04:54.083
helps you,

94
00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:57.083
then you are genuinely grateful.

95
00:04:57.083 --> 00:05:00.333
But if someone does not,

96
00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:03.291
even then you remain at peace.

97
00:05:03.291 --> 00:05:06.250
If success comes, you accept it,

98
00:05:06.250 --> 00:05:10.916
and if it does not, then learning
something from the failure,

99
00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:17.750
you peacefully return to your work once again.

100
00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:19.666
This is

101
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:23.125
the meaning of anapeksha.

102
00:05:23.125 --> 00:05:27.208
The essence of life without expectation.

103
00:05:27.208 --> 00:05:30.250
When you do not seek life's joy

104
00:05:30.250 --> 00:05:32.166
in external things

105
00:05:32.166 --> 00:05:36.625
and people's reactions,

106
00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:38.125
only then

107
00:05:38.125 --> 00:05:41.291
you become free.

108
00:05:41.291 --> 00:05:44.875
Now, you find every joy within yourself

109
00:05:44.875 --> 00:05:49.583
by simply trusting in Me.

110
00:05:49.583 --> 00:05:51.625
The person who

111
00:05:51.625 --> 00:05:54.291
lives without expectations,

112
00:05:54.291 --> 00:05:57.375
is dear not only to Me,

113
00:05:57.375 --> 00:05:59.875
but to everyone,

114
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:03.791
because they help all

115
00:06:03.791 --> 00:06:08.166
without any selfishness.

116
00:06:08.166 --> 00:06:10.875
Give up expectations,

117
00:06:10.875 --> 00:06:12.833
and then watch

118
00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:16.458
how peace and joy

119
00:06:16.458 --> 00:06:18.666
come to you on their own.

120
00:06:23.083 --> 00:06:24.708
Having love for someone

121
00:06:24.708 --> 00:06:28.166
in the family is natural,

122
00:06:28.166 --> 00:06:29.833
but

123
00:06:29.833 --> 00:06:34.708
it is best if this love never takes the form

124
00:06:34.708 --> 00:06:36.416
of favouritism.

125
00:06:36.416 --> 00:06:40.583
Do you take the special side of
someone in the family?

126
00:06:40.583 --> 00:06:44.666
Perhaps a brother or sister,

127
00:06:44.666 --> 00:06:49.125
or one of the parents, or

128
00:06:49.125 --> 00:06:54.125
one of your children? Love is natural.

129
00:06:54.125 --> 00:06:58.166
But taking one particular person's side

130
00:06:58.166 --> 00:07:02.333
in every right and wrong situation,

131
00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:06.541
this can create a rift in the family.

132
00:07:06.541 --> 00:07:09.416
If you want harmony

133
00:07:09.416 --> 00:07:12.458
and balance in the family,

134
00:07:12.458 --> 00:07:15.083
then learn to be udasinah,

135
00:07:15.083 --> 00:07:18.291
meaning to remain impartial.

136
00:07:18.291 --> 00:07:22.541
Here, being unaffected or impartial
does not mean

137
00:07:22.541 --> 00:07:25.375
that whatever may be happening,

138
00:07:25.375 --> 00:07:29.250
it has no effect on you at all.

139
00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:30.958
Here it means

140
00:07:30.958 --> 00:07:32.541
seeing every situation

141
00:07:32.541 --> 00:07:35.541
without any bias.

142
00:07:35.541 --> 00:07:37.708
For example,

143
00:07:37.708 --> 00:07:40.166
if there is a dispute at home,

144
00:07:40.166 --> 00:07:42.500
do not immediately decide in

145
00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:44.791
favour of one person.

146
00:07:44.791 --> 00:07:46.916
First listen to everyone.

147
00:07:46.916 --> 00:07:49.791
Then understand it with sensitivity,

148
00:07:49.791 --> 00:07:54.208
and suggest a solution that is fair.

149
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:57.416
And the truth is, if you listen

150
00:07:57.416 --> 00:08:00.541
and understand with genuine sensitivity,

151
00:08:00.541 --> 00:08:03.583
you will find that ordinarily

152
00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:08.333
a solution where both sides win
is also possible.

153
00:08:08.333 --> 00:08:10.958
The real root of a dispute

154
00:08:10.958 --> 00:08:13.416
is often this,

155
00:08:13.416 --> 00:08:15.416
that both sides

156
00:08:15.416 --> 00:08:18.375
did not truly understand each other.

157
00:08:18.375 --> 00:08:20.708
Do not let that happen.

158
00:08:20.708 --> 00:08:23.666
Listen to both sides.

159
00:08:23.666 --> 00:08:26.125
Think of both sides' interests,

160
00:08:26.125 --> 00:08:28.791
and find a solution

161
00:08:28.791 --> 00:08:31.666
that can resolve everyone's problem.

162
00:08:31.666 --> 00:08:34.250
And even if you must

163
00:08:34.250 --> 00:08:37.333
decide against one person,

164
00:08:37.333 --> 00:08:39.833
do not think of them as wrong.

165
00:08:39.833 --> 00:08:42.500
Lovingly explain the situation to them.

166
00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:46.083
Tell them why this decision is right.

167
00:08:46.083 --> 00:08:50.666
This is how everyone's trust is built.

168
00:08:50.666 --> 00:08:53.791
When everyone in the family knows

169
00:08:53.791 --> 00:08:57.208
that you will not take one person's side,

170
00:08:57.208 --> 00:09:00.500
then they respect you.

171
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:04.375
Your words carry weight with them.

172
00:09:04.375 --> 00:09:06.791
You become for them a pillar

173
00:09:06.791 --> 00:09:10.583
of wisdom and stability.

174
00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:14.083
When you rise above personal attachment

175
00:09:14.083 --> 00:09:15.625
and treat everyone with fairness

176
00:09:15.625 --> 00:09:18.708
and sensitivity,

177
00:09:18.708 --> 00:09:21.625
that is when a home is built

178
00:09:21.625 --> 00:09:25.583
where everyone feels equal.

179
00:09:25.583 --> 00:09:28.791
And where everyone is equal,

180
00:09:28.791 --> 00:09:32.291
there is mutual respect.

181
00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.250
At the workplace,

182
00:09:38.250 --> 00:09:42.000
does this happen to you too?

183
00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:46.708
When you worked hard with your heart,
but received no praise,

184
00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:49.583
or you received praise,

185
00:09:49.583 --> 00:09:53.208
and someone else got more than you,

186
00:09:53.208 --> 00:09:57.500
or even after doing the work well,

187
00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:00.708
the result did not come as you wished?

188
00:10:00.708 --> 00:10:05.625
Does all of this greatly disappoint you?

189
00:10:05.625 --> 00:10:08.250
Think about this,

190
00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:11.125
the root of all these disappointments

191
00:10:11.125 --> 00:10:14.416
is expectations.

192
00:10:14.416 --> 00:10:17.333
Because you hold expectations,

193
00:10:17.333 --> 00:10:21.708
your peace now depends on external situations

194
00:10:21.708 --> 00:10:25.125
and other people.

195
00:10:25.125 --> 00:10:27.166
But if

196
00:10:27.166 --> 00:10:29.833
you give up expectations,

197
00:10:29.833 --> 00:10:32.333
become anapekshah,

198
00:10:32.333 --> 00:10:35.000
then you can truly bring

199
00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:37.833
peace to your mind.

200
00:10:37.833 --> 00:10:41.750
Give your very best effort,

201
00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:44.333
but what will you receive in return?

202
00:10:44.333 --> 00:10:48.000
Do not stay entangled in this thought.

203
00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.958
And now, having given up expectations,

204
00:10:50.958 --> 00:10:54.000
adopt another quality.

205
00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:55.958
Dakshah,

206
00:10:55.958 --> 00:10:57.958
meaning working with full skill

207
00:10:57.958 --> 00:11:01.083
and dedication.

208
00:11:01.083 --> 00:11:04.791
Keep increasing your work competence.

209
00:11:04.791 --> 00:11:07.916
Keep raising the standard of your work.

210
00:11:07.916 --> 00:11:11.541
Now you hold no expectations,

211
00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:15.750
no comparison or envy toward others,

212
00:11:15.750 --> 00:11:19.166
yet the work is done at the highest level.

213
00:11:19.166 --> 00:11:22.166
This will not stay hidden.

214
00:11:22.166 --> 00:11:26.666
Watch, gradually, without expectation,

215
00:11:26.666 --> 00:11:30.416
everyone's trust in you will begin to awaken.

216
00:11:30.416 --> 00:11:31.625
The person who,

217
00:11:31.625 --> 00:11:33.250
without worrying about the fruit,

218
00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:36.375
does their work wholeheartedly,

219
00:11:36.375 --> 00:11:39.416
their mind remains at peace,

220
00:11:39.416 --> 00:11:45.291
and at the same time everyone
respects them too.

221
00:11:45.291 --> 00:11:47.750
Keep growing in skill.

222
00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:50.666
Keep expectations low,

223
00:11:50.666 --> 00:11:54.833
then watch, success and respect,

224
00:11:54.833 --> 00:11:58.750
both will follow you on their own.
